{"id":"vod_md_5235","vodId":"5235","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"幽游白书","name_cn":"幽游白书","date":"1992-01-01","year":"1992","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"112集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230919-1/0458cfcc1fd44e6a3dcded21af86e8bf.jpg"},"summary":"皿屋敷中学的不良少年浦饭幽助终日无所事事，或与青梅竹马雪村萤子吵架拌嘴，或拿死对头桑原和真出气。某日，逃课玩耍的幽助从车轮下救起一位小姑娘，自己则被汽车撞死。他的举动出乎灵界的预料，因此得到一个复活的机会。经过一次次的考验，幽助最终在萤子和桑原的帮助下重返人间。在此之后，他成为一名灵界侦探，专门负责各种奇异的犯罪事件。在一次任务中，幽助又结识了化名南野秀一的妖狐藏马和盗贼飞影。所谓不打不相识，幽助、桑原、藏马、飞影成为共同进退的搭档。他们一同参加了云集强大妖怪的暗黑武术大会，与恐怖的户愚吕兄弟一决胜负。以此为肇始，此后他们与魔界的纠葛越来越深，战斗愈加激烈……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,喜剧,动作,动画,惊悚,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-19 08:03:51","classic":true,"classicRank":40,"franchise":"幽游白书","playable":true,"episodeCount":112,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/hClNWMZY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/hKsNZ2YO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/0j5cIf59/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/YXUD4sop/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/yTBtEIHe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/VNyBjztw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/F8VdEZdP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/LGu2a0Xr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/PnRysn4a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/ZXDv63wA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/dvpX4JcM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/riK6kKpM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/RKG8b18S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/ySbBX5i6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx1